    "notes": "Single session on May 14, 1958. Originally released as two LPs: Blue Lights, Volume 1 (BLP 1596) and Blue Lights, Volume 2 (BLP 1597). Alfred Lion produced; Rudy Van Gelder recorded. Volume 1 A1-A2: full sextet with Duke Jordan piano; B1: quartet (Kenny Burrell, Bobby Timmons, Sam Jones, Art Blakey); B2: full sextet with Bobby Timmons. Volume 2 all tracks: full sextet with Bobby Timmons. Bonus track 'I Never Knew' from 1997 CD reissue not included.",
