    "case_for": "Session gravity is the load-bearing signal \u2014 Burrell with Art Blakey and Sam Jones on every track, alternating Duke Jordan and Bobby Timmons piano, early Blue Note appearances by Tina Brooks, Junior Cook, and Louis Smith. Extended blowing vehicles set Burrell's blues-rooted elegance against Blakey's press rolls. Alfred Lion production, early Andy Warhol cover. AllMusic 4.5\u2605 (S2).",
    "case_against": "Documented consensus is thin \u2014 sources are mostly discographic metadata plus one AllMusic rating. A loose head-solo-head blowing date rather than a defining statement that fixed a sound. Burrell's load-bearing statement is already Midnight Blue in the canon. Album unifies two separately-issued LPs by CD-era repackaging.",
    "disagreement": null,
    "recommendation": "Listen as a consider-tier session-gravity date. Council recommends supplying missing independent consensus evidence before higher tier.",
